<name><surname>Yang</surname><given-names>DG</given-names></name><name><surname>Kim</surname><given-names>KD</given-names></name><name><surname>Shin</surname><given-names>DH</given-names></name><name><surname>Choe</surname><given-names>KO</given-names></name><name><surname>Kim</surname><given-names>SK</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>WY</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Idiopathic bronchiolitis obliterans with organizing pneumonia presenting with spontaneous hydropneumothorax and solitary pulmonary nodule</article-title><source>Respirology</source><year>1999</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>267</fpage><lpage>70</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10489671</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1046/j.1440-1843.1999.00187.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Nizami</surname><given-names>IY</given-names></name><name><surname>Kissner</surname><given-names>DG</given-names></name><name><surname>Visscher</surname><given-names>DW</given-names></name><name><surname>Dubaybo</surname><given-names>BA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Idiopathic bronchiolitis obliterans with organizing pneumonia. An acute and life-threatening syndrome</article-title><source>Chest</source><year>1995</year><volume>108</volume><fpage>271</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7606970</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1378/chest.108.1.271</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>